    "title": "Define and verify Linux release metadata",
    "summary": "Add a Linux-only strict v1 manifest, normalized candidate identity, host requirements, canonical repo/ref channel scope, and detached Ed25519 role grants. Expose the verified subject with the digest of exact original bytes. Keep Darwin callers on their current formats.",
